phis (0.2.17-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * A Site's admin log shows its records. The request's Site is stamped on what Core logs while serving it,
    the journals read are this Core's own unit and the Site's (phis-site-<key>), journalctl filters by the
    Site and reads at most the newest 10 000 records, and the answer says when the window was cut.
  * A hash collision on reading the global translation store is that message's alone: it answers in its
    source text and is not asked of the provider; the rest of the request stays translated.
  * A new Site is scaffolded with antd 6.7.0.

